<title>PORTUGAL: Portugal's S.Costa to resume trade.</title>
<headline>Portugal's S.Costa to resume trade.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Share trade in construction company Soares da Costa will resume at 1030 GMT after being suspended before the start of business on Friday, the Lisbon bourse said.</p>
<p>The stock had been suspended after a newspaper reported that fellow constructor  Teixeira Duarte had launched a takeover bid.</p>
<p>Soares denied the report.</p>
<p>--Lisbon bureau 3511-3150035</p>
</text>
